  3. Whenever a customer returns an item for a change of mind or because it is the wrong item, refund the item prices times quantities, minus any discount code, but never the shipping fee: refund the full amount if the request is made up to and including day 14 after delivery, half of that amount from day 15 through day 30 after delivery, and nothing after day 30 after delivery.
  4. Whenever an order is a final sale, pay no refund for a change-of-mind or wrong-item return.
  5. Whenever an item arrives damaged and the request is made up to and including day 90 after delivery, refund the item prices times quantities, minus any discount code, plus the shipping fee; if the order was paid by card, refund that amount to the card it was paid with. Nothing is refunded for damaged goods after day 90 after delivery.
  6. Whenever a refund for an item that did not arrive damaged works out to less than ₹50, pay no refund.
  7. Whenever a refund is calculated, round it down to whole rupees.
  8. Whenever an order has been fully refunded, take back none of the points it earned, even if some of those points were spent on a later order.
